				19,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Deps/Rust): Update Documentation/Rust submodule to c3f97afa\n\nSync the Rust documentation submodule from commit c7abf568 to c3f97afa. This update aligns the in-tree documentation with the latest upstream Rust standards and CodeEditorLand-specific Rust practices, ensuring accuracy for the Mist WebSocket and DNS server implementations.\n\nThe submodule reference is advanced without local code changes in the current tree.",
